  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Helpers%27_House?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b5/Helpers_House.png/revision/latest?cb=20180823140031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Helpers&amp;#39; house\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Helpers&amp;#39; house\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Helpers' house</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>helpers' house</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/buildings-3577\" title=\"Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">building</a> where two farmer helpers, <a href=\"/wiki/rose-26084\" title=\"Rose\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Rose</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/ernest-26082\" title=\"Ernest\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ernest</a>, live.\n</p><p>The house is located above the <a href=\"/wiki/mine-7452\" title=\"Mine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mine</a>, up on the cliff.\n</p><p>It is unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 33.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Hiring helpers</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f1/Ernest_%26_Rose.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028163442\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Ernest &amp;amp; Rose\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>Players can hire <a href=\"/wiki/rose-26084\" title=\"Rose\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Rose</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/ernest-26082\" title=\"Ernest\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ernest</a> by tapping the house. Otherwise both are seen sitting at a table knitting and reading the paper.\n</p><p>When there is a discount a yellow flag is seen next to their house.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Rose</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/4f/Rose.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028162916\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Rose\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Rose\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Rose</figcaption></figure>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/rose-26084\" title=\"Rose\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Rose</a></i>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/rose-26084\" title=\"Rose\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Rose</a> can run the <a href=\"/wiki/feed-mill-3546\" title=\"Feed Mill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Feed Mill</a> using the player's <a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">crops</a>, feed the player's farm <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animals</a>, and collect <a href=\"/wiki/animal-goods-7457\" title=\"Animal Goods\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">goods</a> when ready.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Ernest</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a9/Ernest.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028163304\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Ernest\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Ernest\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Ernest</figcaption></figure>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/ernest-26082\" title=\"Ernest\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ernest</a></i>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/ernest-26082\" title=\"Ernest\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ernest</a> can run the <a href=\"/wiki/dairy-3547\" title=\"Dairy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Dairy</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/sugar-mill-3550\" title=\"Sugar Mill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sugar Mill</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>See also</b></span></h3>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-animal-shelters-6565\" title=\"Category:Animal Shelters (467 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2e/Chicken_Coop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150713110707\" title=\"Category:Animal Shelters (467 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Category:Animal Shelters (467 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn (331 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f8/Barn.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250926033811\" title=\"Barn (331 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Barn (331 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"